            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Open Gemini or another web tool alongside your PDF in a resizable companion browser. Click **Ask Gemini** in the title bar or press **Option–Command–G**.
- Use **Ask Gemini** on selected PDF text to copy the selection and open the browser. Paste the text when you are ready to share it.

**Full changelog**: https://github.com/basicv8vc/YoPDF/compare/v2026.11.24...v2026.11.24.2
]]></description>
