            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's changed

- Sticker notes now show a single YoPDF hover card without a duplicate PDFKit tooltip.
- The expanded note editor is centered in the reader window, so it stays visible when you open it from either side of a PDF.
- Removed the Markdown editor theme picker.

**Full changelog**: https://github.com/basicv8vc/YoPDF/compare/v2026.11.18.2...v2026.11.24
]]></description>
